    <statement><p>Evaluate the iterated integral <m>\displaystyle
\int_0^{3} \int_0^{e^v} \!\! \sqrt{1+e^v} \,dw\, dv.</m></p>
<p>Answer: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{2}{3}\mathopen{}\left(\left(e^{3}+1\right)^{\frac{3}{2}}-2^{\frac{3}{2}}\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
